/* DESIGN Window definition (used by the UIB) 
  CREATE WINDOW B-table-Win ASSIGN
         HEIGHT             = 8.57
         WIDTH              = 150.8.
/* END WINDOW DEFINITION */
                                                                        */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

